# Rollout facts

The API is deployed as a rolling set of instances; old and new versions overlap for up to two minutes.
A per-tenant feature flag is available and is currently off for all tenants.
PostgreSQL supports CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY for the planned GIN label index.
The team targets p95 below 250 ms for list calls. Database timeouts currently return 503 with a request ID.
There is no new database, queue, or third-party search dependency in the feature brief.
